#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid ""
"Serve the built frontend and FastAPI backend using CLI or environment "
"defaults."
msgstr "使用 CLI 或环境变量默认值运行已构建的前端和 FastAPI 后端。"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "`python app.py --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8042 --open`"
msgstr "`python app.py --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8042 --open`"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "Recommended local documentation command."
msgstr "推荐的本地文档命令。"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "`python app.py --reload`"
msgstr "`python app.py --reload`"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "Enable Uvicorn source reload."
msgstr "启用 Uvicorn 源码热重载。"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "`COMFYRESEARCH_PORT=8042 npm --prefix frontend run dev`"
msgstr "`COMFYRESEARCH_PORT=8042 npm --prefix frontend run dev`"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "Run Vite and proxy `/api` to backend port 8042."
msgstr "运行 Vite，并将 `/api` 代理到后端端口 8042。"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "`npm --prefix frontend run build`"
msgstr "`npm --prefix frontend run build`"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:6
msgid "Build the static frontend and run generated-contract checks."
msgstr "构建静态前端并运行生成契约检查。"

