#: ../../en/reference/application.md:33
msgid ""
"The source host default exposes the service on available interfaces. Use "
"an explicit `--host 127.0.0.1` for normal local work unless network "
"access has been deliberately reviewed."
msgstr "源码的默认主机会在可用接口上暴露服务。除非已专门审查网络访问，否则日常本地工作请显式使用 `--host 127.0.0.1`。"

#: ../../en/reference/application.md:37
msgid ""
"Boolean environment values accept the forms implemented by `app.py`: "
"`COMFYRESEARCH_RELOAD` accepts `1`, `true`, or `yes` after lowercasing; "
"`COMFYRESEARCH_OPEN_BROWSER` accepts the same values."
msgstr ""
"布尔环境变量接受 `app.py` 实现的形式：`COMFYRESEARCH_RELOAD` 转为小写后接受 `1`、`true` 或 "
"`yes`；`COMFYRESEARCH_OPEN_BROWSER` 接受相同的值。"

