#: ../../en/reference/application.md:54
msgid ""
"An active stored config takes precedence over environment variables. It "
"is active only when `enabled`, `host`, and `remote_path` are set. If no "
"stored config is active, an active environment config is used; otherwise "
"execution is local."
msgstr ""
"已启用的已保存配置优先于环境变量。只有设置了 `enabled`、`host` 和 `remote_path` "
"时它才生效。若没有已启用的已保存配置，则使用已启用的环境配置；否则在本地执行。"

